# edge GU: frames=8: the attempt at 0 exhausts frames inside the lookahead; the hat skips it (a in not S = {x})
# Q-R3 GIVE-UP ALLOWANCE: the cases below are the HAT's answer (libpcre2's, unbounded). The deny arm (-fno-start-set, i.e. today's emitter) gives up (gu frames) where its attempt at a non-S byte exhausts the frames; a give-up may become this answer, never the reverse.
# pcre2-only
pattern (?=(?:a|b|x)*c)x
features all
engine vm
budget frames=8
tag edge=GU, giveup_allowance
